      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract / execution risk",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Agents autonomously signing transactions across DeFi protocols compress human review time to zero, meaning a single misconfigured permission or poisoned tool-call can drain a treasury before any circuit-breaker fires.",
