        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Anthropic managed agents, Visa Intelligent Commerce Connect, and Kite Mainnet each position a single corporate entity as the chokepoint for agent deployment, payment routing, or identity — recreating Web2 platform risk inside agent infrastructure.",
