        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Catena Labs filing for an OCC trust charter and BNY's role as financial agent for a U.S. government children's investment program signal regulators are actively mapping agents into existing financial supervisory frameworks faster than the sector anticipated.",
